#: goverlay_strings.rssteamshortcutflatpakinfo
msgid ""
"To add Goverlay to your Steam Library in Desktop Mode:\n"
"\n"
"Method 1 (Application Menu):\n"
"1. Open the Application Launcher (bottom-left corner).\n"
"2. Locate Goverlay under System, Utilities, or Games.\n"
"3. Right-click on Goverlay and select \"Add to Steam\".\n"
"\n"
"Method 2 (Steam Client):\n"
"1. In Steam, click \"Games\" in the top menu.\n"
"2. Select \"Add a Non-Steam Game to My Library...\".\n"
"3. Choose Goverlay from the list and click \"Add Selected Programs\"."
msgstr "在桌面模式下将 Goverlay 加入 Steam 库：\n\n方式一（应用菜单）：\n1. 打开应用启动器（左下角）。\n2. 在「系统」、「工具」或「游戏」中找到 Goverlay。\n3. 右键点击 Goverlay，选择「添加到 Steam」。\n\n方式二（Steam 客户端）：\n1. 在 Steam 顶部菜单点击「游戏」。\n2. 选择「将非 Steam 游戏添加到我的库…」。\n3. 在列表中选择 Goverlay，点击「添加所选程序」。"

