#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Alternative descriptor heap for D3D12. Fixes ray tracing in Control Resonant and similar titles, but may decrease performance or crash in other games."
msgstr "D3D12 的替代描述符堆。可修复 Control Resonant 等游戏的光线追踪，但其他游戏可能掉帧或崩溃。"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Custom Arguments"
msgstr "自定义启动参数"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Custom environment variable"
msgstr "自定义环境变量"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Custom items added in Global mode are cataloged and can be toggled per game."
msgstr "在全局模式下新增的自定义项会被收录，可按游戏单独开关。"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Custom launch argument"
msgstr "自定义启动参数"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Disables Wine detection in RE Engine games to avoid crashes or black screens."
msgstr "在 RE 引擎游戏中关闭 Wine 检测，避免崩溃或黑屏。"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Enter launch argument (-arg or +arg):"
msgstr "输入启动参数（-arg 或 +arg）："

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Enter multiplier for Ray Tracing Acceleration Structures size:"
msgstr "输入光线追踪加速结构的尺寸倍数："

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Experimental options can cause instability or crashes. Use with caution."
msgstr "实验性选项可能导致不稳定甚至崩溃，请谨慎使用。"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Forces NVIDIA DLSS Ray Reconstruction on supported hardware and titles."
msgstr "在支持的硬件和游戏中强制启用 NVIDIA DLSS 光线重建。"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Forces OpenGL to run over Vulkan via Mesa Zink driver (experimental)."
msgstr "通过 Mesa Zink 驱动让 OpenGL 跑在 Vulkan 上（实验性）。"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Game-specific custom variable"
msgstr "仅对当前游戏的变量"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Game-specific launch argument"
msgstr "仅对当前游戏的启动参数"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "GameMode is not installed"
msgstr "未安装 GameMode"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Global catalog argument"
msgstr "全局设定中的参数"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Global catalog items are listed below. Toggling applies only to this game."
msgstr "下面列出的是全局设定中的项目，这里的开关只对当前游戏生效。"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Global catalog preset"
msgstr "全局设定中的预设"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Korthos Low Latency is not installed"
msgstr "未安装 Korthos 低延迟层"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Multiplies Ray Tracing Acceleration Structures buffer size by 8 to prevent RT out-of-memory crashes."
msgstr "把光线追踪加速结构的缓冲区放大 8 倍，避免光追因显存不足而崩溃。"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Needs Korthos low latency"
msgstr "需要 Korthos 低延迟层"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Predefined Arguments"
msgstr "预定义启动参数"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "System package not found. Please install 'gamemode' using your package manager."
msgstr "系统里找不到该软件包，请用包管理器安装 gamemode。"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "System package not found. Please install 'vulkan-low-latency-layer' using your package manager."
msgstr "系统里找不到该软件包，请用包管理器安装 vulkan-low-latency-layer。"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "VKD3D RTAS Size Multiplier"
msgstr "VKD3D RTAS 尺寸倍数"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "Works only with CachyOS"
msgstr "仅在 CachyOS 上有效"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "＋ No custom arguments added yet. Click the + button to create one."
msgstr "＋ 还没有自定义参数，点 + 按钮新建一个。"

#: tweaks_md3.pas
msgid "＋ No custom variables added yet. Click the + button to create one."
msgstr "＋ 还没有自定义变量，点 + 按钮新建一个。"
